## Goal
Clean up tagger and drive train/review preview from appMachine without persisting progress.

## Done when
1. moveIndexAtTime lives in data/moveTimestamps and is used by useMoveTimeline and tagger (unsorted A2-safe).
2. initEqualTimestamps removed; equal-slice only via resolveMoveTimestamps.
3. parseTimestampsJson does not expose unused deckId (or deck switch is intentional - prefer drop).
4. SEED does not wipe in-memory timestamps when returning from train/review tab.
5. Tagger train preview uses appMachine session path with a preview/ephemeral flag so progress is not saved; local createPreviewSession/advancePreviewSession removed from TaggerView.
6. Tests green for moveTimestamps, taggerMachine, useMoveTimeline unsorted case.

## Out of scope
Enforcing monotonic timestamps on drag; visual scrubber redesign.